WEBVTT

00:16.180 --> 00:17.640
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

00:27.070 --> 00:31.570
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

00:32.820 --> 00:37.120
<b><i>The story always revolves around us</i></b>

00:37.500 --> 00:42.000
<b><i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i></b>

00:42.500 --> 00:47.420
<b><i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i></b>

00:47.590 --> 00:52.430
<b><i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i></b>

00:52.550 --> 00:56.390
<b><i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i></b>

00:56.520 --> 01:03.110
<b><i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i></b>

01:03.440 --> 01:08.110
<b><i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i></b>

01:08.280 --> 01:12.780
<b><i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i></b>

01:12.950 --> 01:16.790
<b><i>This is the plot of our survival</i></b>

01:17.160 --> 01:22.500
<b><i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i></b>

01:22.670 --> 01:27.420
<b><i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i></b>

01:27.550 --> 01:31.800
<b><i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i></b>

01:31.930 --> 01:34.930
<b><i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i></b>

01:35.050 --> 01:38.560
<b><i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i></b>

01:38.720 --> 01:41.850
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i></b>

01:41.980 --> 01:43.350
<b><i>Following the steady beat</i></b>

01:43.690 --> 01:48.650
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

01:49.690 --> 01:51.530
<b>- Nono-chan!
- And Arale's...</b>

01:51.650 --> 01:54.360
<b>Collab song reveal!</b>

01:54.530 --> 02:00.080
<b>Collab Announcement</b>

01:54.820 --> 01:57.700
<b>- They're cooking up something.
- Looks like it.</b>

01:57.830 --> 02:00.080
<b>Arale-chan, please announce it!</b>

02:00.500 --> 02:03.620
<b>Our memorable first-ever collab song</b>

02:03.870 --> 02:05.960
<b>is Magilulu's first opening song,</b>

02:06.080 --> 02:08.460
<b>"Magilulu Nice Bulk"!</b>

02:08.840 --> 02:12.470
<b>Or from season two,
"Tears of Shani-comers"!</b>

02:12.590 --> 02:16.970
<b>Or maybe the theme song from the movie,
"Good-Bye, Biceps"!</b>

02:17.390 --> 02:19.970
<b>- One of these three.
- They haven't decided?</b>

02:21.560 --> 02:24.140
<b>You like all these songs, right?</b>

02:24.270 --> 02:28.270
<b>Yes. The timing of "Good-Bye, Biceps"
in the movie is so...</b>

02:28.400 --> 02:30.230
<b>Then, let's go with that one.</b>

02:33.490 --> 02:34.360
<b>Okay.</b>

02:34.530 --> 02:37.950
<b>It's decided! What about the thumbnail?</b>

02:38.080 --> 02:39.370
<b>No, no, no!</b>

02:39.530 --> 02:43.620
<b>Asking Yako-sensei
to do this is way over the line!</b>

02:43.910 --> 02:45.540
<b>I can if I have time.</b>

02:45.670 --> 02:47.920
<b>No, you have your own work to do.</b>

02:48.250 --> 02:51.800
<b>I'll ask properly through the agency
and pay you myself.</b>

02:51.920 --> 02:54.380
<b>Someday, I swear! No matter what!</b>

02:54.510 --> 02:55.300
<b>She's too much...</b>

02:55.510 --> 02:58.100
<b>- I'll be waiting.
- Oh, you're all here.</b>

02:58.350 --> 03:00.720
<b>All right, let's start practice.</b>

03:00.850 --> 03:02.220
<b>Okay!</b>

03:08.650 --> 03:09.480
<b>I don't know.</b>

03:10.150 --> 03:11.480
<b>It's just...</b>

03:11.940 --> 03:14.240
<b>Nono-chan-san's so sweet.</b>

03:14.570 --> 03:16.990
<b>My beloved Yako-sensei is here,</b>

03:17.410 --> 03:20.490
<b>and Yuno-san-chan is a high-spec robot.</b>

03:21.870 --> 03:24.830
<b>Right now, I really...</b>

03:25.500 --> 03:27.250
<b>really want to sing!</b>

03:30.090 --> 03:32.800
<b>Wow! You're turning into a real band!</b>

03:32.920 --> 03:33.880
<b>Hehe!</b>

03:34.010 --> 03:36.930
<b>- Did you practice a lot?
- Not that much.</b>

03:39.050 --> 03:40.890
<b>W... What is it?</b>

03:41.010 --> 03:45.430
<b>The bags under your eyes are gone,
so you look like a polar bear!</b>

03:45.640 --> 03:47.140
<b>Fairly healthy!</b>

03:47.270 --> 03:49.350
<b>Work hard, but don't overdo it.</b>

03:49.480 --> 03:52.570
<b>I also noticed something.</b>

03:52.690 --> 03:56.610
<b>Arale-chan, you were humming
just now, weren't you?</b>

03:57.490 --> 03:59.280
<b>Oh, that was you, Arale-san?</b>

03:59.410 --> 04:01.450
<b>No way! That's impossible!</b>

04:03.870 --> 04:05.790
<b>Just a hum, but it's clearly you.</b>

04:05.910 --> 04:09.330
<b>Maybe you can join us
for our next practice.</b>

04:10.790 --> 04:14.340
<b>I could potentially make that happen.</b>

04:14.500 --> 04:17.090
<b>- Yay!
- Nakamachi-san!</b>

04:17.260 --> 04:18.510
<b>I can't wait.</b>

04:18.630 --> 04:20.550
<b>Thank y... Maru-kun can talk?!</b>

04:20.680 --> 04:22.050
<b>Yo, nice to meet you.</b>

04:22.350 --> 04:23.640
<b>What's going on?</b>

04:23.760 --> 04:25.850
<b>- Well...
- Let go of me!</b>

04:25.970 --> 04:28.770
<b>Let me hug him too.</b>

04:31.480 --> 04:33.270
<b>Yay!</b>

04:33.440 --> 04:36.780
<b>It's fun hanging out
with everyone, after all.</b>

04:37.070 --> 04:38.320
<b>Okay, then.</b>

04:40.910 --> 04:43.160
<b>Alrighty, mic's set.</b>

04:43.330 --> 04:48.410
<b>And then, run this cable over there...</b>

04:49.160 --> 04:50.290
<b>Yuno:
Let's talk</b>

04:58.090 --> 05:00.840
<b>No, this doesn't sound like me.</b>

05:02.550 --> 05:03.470
<b>Unsend message</b>

05:10.480 --> 05:11.270
<b>Yikes.</b>

05:11.440 --> 05:14.310
<b>Erea is trash
Poor Viola</b>

05:11.940 --> 05:14.110
<b>They've got issues, all right.</b>

05:14.650 --> 05:16.270
<b>And send!</b>

05:16.440 --> 05:17.480
<b>Good-Bye, Biceps...Gt.wav</b>

05:16.730 --> 05:19.530
<b>Nono-chan,
I'm hopping in the bath first!</b>

05:19.650 --> 05:23.620
<b>Oh, I'll splish-splash with you too!</b>

05:27.160 --> 05:28.620
<b>It's here!</b>

05:28.790 --> 05:29.870
<b>Arale's room</b>

05:30.250 --> 05:31.620
<b>Recording!</b>

05:36.500 --> 05:38.000
<b>"Dreams are power!"</b>

05:38.170 --> 05:39.510
<b>"Dreams are power!"</b>

05:38.170 --> 05:38.960
<b>Alarm</b>

05:39.840 --> 05:41.800
<b>Dreams are power!</b>

05:44.300 --> 05:50.230
<b>All right, let's see how the video
I uploaded yesterday is doing.</b>

06:01.070 --> 06:02.200
<b>Arale-chan's on fire!
Amazing!</b>

06:04.950 --> 06:06.700
<b>The air's so fresh!</b>

06:07.080 --> 06:08.990
<b>The sky's so blue!</b>

06:09.200 --> 06:12.330
<b>I feel incredible!</b>

06:17.210 --> 06:18.710
<b>Viola Quiz!</b>

06:19.000 --> 06:23.630
<b>Just how many trains
is Ritsu going to miss?</b>

06:27.970 --> 06:29.810
<b>The answer is...</b>

06:29.930 --> 06:32.430
<b>A model student wouldn't do that.</b>

06:33.520 --> 06:35.350
<b>Ritsu?</b>

06:35.650 --> 06:38.110
<b>Come on, you're zoning out.</b>

06:38.230 --> 06:39.440
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

06:39.570 --> 06:43.490
<b>Look. Arale-chan uploaded a video.</b>

06:43.610 --> 06:46.820
<b>Her account name is
"MewType Arale Nakamachi."</b>

06:47.160 --> 06:49.370
<b>Is Arale Nakamachi her real name?</b>

06:49.490 --> 06:54.250
<b>It is. Using your real name
can be dangerous, you know.</b>

06:54.370 --> 06:56.880
<b>- Bad people are out there.
- Scary!</b>

06:57.000 --> 06:59.670
<b>Ritsu, let's listen to it.</b>

06:59.840 --> 07:02.340
<b>Magilulu Movie Theme Song
"Good-Bye, Biceps"</b>

07:04.510 --> 07:07.090
<b>- Is this Magilulu?
- Takes me back.</b>

07:07.220 --> 07:08.850
<b>What's up with her taste?</b>

07:09.550 --> 07:13.770
<b>I wonder if Arale-chan
is doing well in her group.</b>

07:14.430 --> 07:17.400
<b>The one on guitar is from her group.</b>

07:17.650 --> 07:20.190
<b>- Wait, Nonoka?
- She's Usa Eater-chan.</b>

07:20.320 --> 07:23.070
<b>She's the one who hit 100 million views!</b>

07:23.230 --> 07:26.700
<b>It was always Ritsu
accompanying Arale-chan back then.</b>

07:27.160 --> 07:30.410
<b>I guess you're no longer needed, Ritsu.</b>

07:31.160 --> 07:33.540
<b>I've got some things to do back home.</b>

07:34.040 --> 07:36.120
<b>- Bye-bye.
- See you.</b>

07:38.540 --> 07:42.920
<b>Ritsu's been so fun lately.</b>

07:51.680 --> 07:53.930
<b>"Just a little more unlimited!"</b>

07:58.850 --> 08:01.310
<b>Arale-chan is just too dazzling.</b>

08:02.190 --> 08:03.690
<b>Why don't you just do as you like?</b>

08:03.860 --> 08:06.860
<b>"Just me Unlimited" Lyrics by Erea</b>

08:05.320 --> 08:06.900
<b>I can't do that.</b>

08:08.240 --> 08:12.490
<b>Because back then, Arale-chan and I...</b>

08:12.990 --> 08:15.910
<b>Right, Magical Physical Kululu.</b>

08:16.120 --> 08:17.910
<b>Magilulu for short.</b>

08:18.420 --> 08:20.080
<b>This will be on the test.</b>

08:20.250 --> 08:23.380
<b>Wow, Arale-chan,
you sound just like the teacher!</b>

08:26.880 --> 08:30.300
<b>I first met Arale-chan
back in elementary school.</b>

08:30.470 --> 08:31.260
<b>Ta-da!</b>

08:32.260 --> 08:35.640
<b>I wrote down our chats,
and it turned into lyrics!</b>

08:35.930 --> 08:38.100
<b>A huge discovery! I'm a genius!</b>

08:38.230 --> 08:40.810
<b>Wow. Arale-chan, you're incredible!</b>

08:41.810 --> 08:44.820
<b>To me, Arale-chan was cheerful</b>

08:45.320 --> 08:46.990
<b>and so fun to be around.</b>

08:47.110 --> 08:49.200
<b>This is your math notebook.</b>

08:49.900 --> 08:50.910
<b>And then,</b>

08:51.360 --> 08:55.620
<b>the biceps of the Yumeoi Town
residents started glowing!</b>

08:55.740 --> 08:56.910
<b>That's so weird.</b>

08:57.750 --> 08:59.120
<b>I know, right?</b>

08:59.620 --> 09:00.420
<b>Rit-chan.</b>

09:00.920 --> 09:02.000
<b>Let's sing together.</b>

09:02.380 --> 09:03.420
<b>Sure.</b>

09:04.000 --> 09:04.880
<b>What song?</b>

09:05.000 --> 09:07.510
<b>"Good-Bye, Biceps"!</b>

09:07.630 --> 09:10.090
<b>Kilometer after kilometer...</b>

09:10.220 --> 09:15.560
<b>Arale-chan was always dazzling.
She was my light.</b>

09:17.470 --> 09:19.600
<b>You're going to a private school?</b>

09:20.230 --> 09:21.480
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:21.600 --> 09:23.190
<b>I see.</b>

09:24.900 --> 09:26.440
<b>Nothing will change.</b>

09:27.650 --> 09:30.070
<b>We'll still be friends forever.</b>

09:30.820 --> 09:32.320
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

09:32.910 --> 09:34.070
<b>Yeah!</b>

09:34.450 --> 09:38.200
<b>"Swift the river, split by stone..."</b>

09:38.500 --> 09:40.710
<b>"Yet apart, we'll meet at last."</b>

09:52.090 --> 09:57.760
<b>"Magical real physical
Magilulu nice..."</b>

09:52.090 --> 09:55.890
<b>Magilulu Opening and Ending Songs
Complete List</b>

09:58.430 --> 10:01.020
<b>Erea Magilulu Cover!!</b>

09:58.890 --> 10:01.430
<b>"Magical, Magi Physical..."</b>

10:01.570 --> 10:03.900
<b>I know this voice.</b>

10:06.440 --> 10:09.400
<b>Is Erea you, Arale-chan?</b>

10:09.530 --> 10:10.780
<b>Arale Nakamachi</b>

10:11.610 --> 10:14.030
<b>- Arale-chan?
- How did you know?!</b>

10:14.360 --> 10:16.530
<b>- I'm shocked!
- So I was right.</b>

10:16.830 --> 10:20.290
<b>I used the letters
of my name to write "Erea."</b>

10:20.410 --> 10:21.330
<b>Like an anagram?</b>

10:21.500 --> 10:24.580
<b>Yup. Cute, right? I'm a genius!</b>

10:24.710 --> 10:26.540
<b>You haven't changed at all.</b>

10:26.670 --> 10:29.170
<b>I grew a bit taller. How about you?</b>

10:29.300 --> 10:30.670
<b>Me?</b>

10:31.550 --> 10:33.090
<b>I want to change.</b>

10:33.880 --> 10:34.680
<b>A group?</b>

10:34.800 --> 10:39.850
<b>Yeah. We wanted to have fun together
singing and filming videos.</b>

10:39.970 --> 10:43.310
<b>- But if you're busy studying...
- I want to join.</b>

10:44.140 --> 10:46.100
<b>I want to give it a try!</b>

10:46.520 --> 10:50.570
<b>Hello, everyone. I'm Utami,
the leader of La La La La Girls.</b>

10:50.690 --> 10:52.820
<b>I'm A-ko. I write music, too.</b>

10:52.940 --> 10:55.570
<b>I'm Viola, everyone's little sister!</b>

10:55.700 --> 10:58.620
<b>I... I'm Erea, and I love singing!</b>

10:58.740 --> 10:59.740
<b>And...</b>

10:59.870 --> 11:01.290
<b>H... hello.</b>

11:01.870 --> 11:04.290
<b>Are you all vocalists?</b>

11:04.410 --> 11:06.330
<b>I forgot to tell her...</b>

11:06.460 --> 11:08.000
<b>I can't really sing...</b>

11:08.130 --> 11:09.340
<b>I see.</b>

11:10.000 --> 11:11.840
<b>What should we do?</b>

11:12.800 --> 11:16.630
<b>How about being a musician?
Utami-san mentioned it before.</b>

11:16.760 --> 11:18.090
<b>Yes, that's it!</b>

11:18.260 --> 11:20.970
<b>Guitar! You can play a bit, right?</b>

11:21.100 --> 11:23.350
<b>Rit-chan will play, and I'll sing!</b>

11:23.890 --> 11:25.850
<b>R-I-T...</b>

11:26.140 --> 11:27.650
<b>S-U...</b>

11:27.770 --> 11:28.810
<b>Clematis.</b>

11:29.110 --> 11:33.940
<b>This flower means "beauty of spirit."
It really fits our model student.</b>

11:34.190 --> 11:35.780
<b>That's so cool.</b>

11:35.900 --> 11:37.570
<b>I'll be Clematis.</b>

11:37.950 --> 11:40.160
<b>I'm glad you like it.</b>

11:40.580 --> 11:46.370
<b>I'm Clematis, and I'm learning
the guitar. Thank you for having me.</b>

11:47.170 --> 11:48.790
<b>Clematis.</b>

11:56.630 --> 11:59.590
<b>La La La La Girls</b>

11:59.930 --> 12:03.060
<b>We have some exciting news
for you all today.</b>

12:00.350 --> 12:07.140
<b>Big announcement
Finally! La La La La Girls</b>

12:03.180 --> 12:07.810
<b>Guess what! We've now joined an agency!</b>

12:09.560 --> 12:12.190
<b>How amazing is it
that we've entered an agency?</b>

12:12.320 --> 12:13.400
<b>I know!</b>

12:13.520 --> 12:16.070
<b>We'll need to attract new fans.</b>

12:16.190 --> 12:18.860
<b>How about reviewing
the group's direction?</b>

12:18.990 --> 12:21.910
<b>I think we're fine as we are.</b>

12:22.030 --> 12:23.700
<b>Oh, really?</b>

12:23.830 --> 12:26.500
<b>Excuse me.
You're La La La La Girls, right?</b>

12:26.660 --> 12:30.290
<b>Wow, you're real!
You're all so cute!</b>

12:30.420 --> 12:33.250
<b>I've seen all your videos.
Can we take a photo?</b>

12:33.380 --> 12:35.710
<b>- A ph... pho...
- A photo? Sure...</b>

12:35.840 --> 12:36.880
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

12:37.130 --> 12:38.630
<b>We really need to go.</b>

12:38.880 --> 12:41.260
<b>- Huh?
- That's too bad.</b>

12:41.640 --> 12:45.100
<b>- I can't wait for your next video.
- Keep it up!</b>

12:45.560 --> 12:50.190
<b>You two are still in middle school.
Let's not be too close to fans, okay?</b>

12:50.520 --> 12:52.980
<b>- Yes.
- Okay.</b>

12:53.770 --> 13:00.280
<b>Announcement regarding Utami,
leader of La La La La Girls</b>

12:54.650 --> 12:58.070
<b>I have something
important to tell everyone.</b>

12:58.190 --> 13:02.410
<b>I have decided
to leave La La La La Girls.</b>

13:02.620 --> 13:05.490
<b>- No way...
- Why?</b>

13:05.620 --> 13:09.540
<b>What? But why all of a sudden?</b>

13:09.660 --> 13:11.330
<b>Viola-chan will become the leader.</b>

13:11.670 --> 13:12.960
<b>So from now on,</b>

13:13.080 --> 13:15.710
<b>we'll be posting videos nonstop.</b>

13:16.170 --> 13:19.670
<b>- So many cameras!
- Will we be filming all the time?</b>

13:20.010 --> 13:23.760
<b>That's right.
Fans want to see this kind of stuff.</b>

13:24.100 --> 13:28.680
<b>So Ritsu's the model student.
A-ko's the aloof but affectionate type.</b>

13:28.810 --> 13:32.770
<b>Arale-chan's the bubbly goof,
and I'm the little sister type.</b>

13:33.190 --> 13:35.770
<b>Remember to think about the fans, okay?</b>

13:36.230 --> 13:38.230
<b>Number one on the daily chart?</b>

13:37.070 --> 13:39.400
<b>'Just me Unlimited' Lyrics by Erea</b>

13:38.360 --> 13:39.400
<b>Our last video?</b>

13:39.690 --> 13:42.200
<b>No way, it's blowing up!</b>

13:42.320 --> 13:44.410
<b>Yeah, just like Viola said.</b>

13:44.530 --> 13:45.660
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:46.080 --> 13:47.790
<b>Isn't Clematis a bit boring?</b>

13:49.120 --> 13:50.410
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

13:50.710 --> 13:54.380
<b>I've already told you
this kind of thing is a problem.</b>

13:54.960 --> 13:57.300
<b>Erea-chan, do you work out?</b>

13:57.420 --> 13:58.340
<b>Nope.</b>

13:58.460 --> 14:03.220
<b>But in Magilulu, they say
a magical power lives in a healthy body.</b>

14:03.340 --> 14:06.640
<b>Honestly, I feel like
such a gullible fan.</b>

14:06.760 --> 14:09.850
<b>The glowing Magical Shaker
is coming out soon.</b>

14:09.970 --> 14:14.520
<b>And I hear the Shani-comers crab sticks
will be restocked on the same day.</b>

14:14.650 --> 14:17.940
<b>Viola-chan, could you
cover one of them for me?</b>

14:18.190 --> 14:22.950
<b>Thanks to your chatter,
my image is falling apart.</b>

14:23.280 --> 14:24.280
<b>Oh really?</b>

14:24.410 --> 14:27.620
<b>I got crab sticks for you.
I'll bring them tomorrow.</b>

14:27.740 --> 14:28.620
<b>Everyone can try them.</b>

14:29.790 --> 14:35.420
<b>I see. You don't get it. Well, then...</b>

14:35.670 --> 14:39.250
<b>I guess you can stay the way you are.</b>

14:39.670 --> 14:40.840
<b>Bye, Rit-chan!</b>

14:41.170 --> 14:42.760
<b>See you tomorrow.</b>

14:45.640 --> 14:48.600
<b>Arale-chan is just too dazzling.</b>

14:49.720 --> 14:52.180
<b>Unlike me...</b>

14:53.730 --> 14:55.140
<b>I want to change</b>

14:55.520 --> 14:57.690
<b>and leave my boring self behind.</b>

14:58.690 --> 15:00.480
<b>Ritsu.</b>

15:00.900 --> 15:04.650
<b>- Viola.
- You were having bad thoughts, right?</b>

15:06.570 --> 15:08.700
<b>Actually, for our next cover song,</b>

15:08.830 --> 15:12.500
<b>I want to do the Magilulu
theme song with Arale-chan.</b>

15:12.620 --> 15:15.160
<b>I've never tried a song like that.</b>

15:15.290 --> 15:17.460
<b>You don't get it.</b>

15:17.580 --> 15:20.670
<b>I'm saying it would ruin your character.</b>

15:20.800 --> 15:23.840
<b>Did you compare yourself
with Arale-chan?</b>

15:24.130 --> 15:26.800
<b>- But...
- You're fine the way you are.</b>

15:26.930 --> 15:30.050
<b>Without your model-student act,</b>

15:30.180 --> 15:33.600
<b>you're just jealous, gloomy, and quiet.</b>

15:34.230 --> 15:35.770
<b>What's left of you?</b>

15:36.350 --> 15:39.940
<b>But I understand why you look up to her.</b>

15:40.190 --> 15:43.110
<b>Arale-chan is already
entertaining as herself,</b>

15:43.230 --> 15:45.360
<b>and her lyrics are amazing too.</b>

15:45.490 --> 15:48.360
<b>Erea's songs are getting insane numbers.</b>

15:46.780 --> 15:48.360
<b>"Just me Unlimited" Lyrics by Erea</b>

15:48.660 --> 15:53.540
<b>These numbers really seem like
they could spark something big.</b>

15:58.880 --> 16:01.710
<b>Erea-chan, I would like your opinion
on how I sing this part.</b>

16:01.920 --> 16:04.670
<b>I heard it! I think it's really good!</b>

16:04.800 --> 16:06.970
<b>Compared to that, I'm...</b>

16:07.130 --> 16:09.390
<b>not so great, huh?</b>

16:10.510 --> 16:12.850
<b>Personally, I'd say it's terrible.</b>

16:12.970 --> 16:15.980
<b>Come on! This part definitely
needs to be growled out!</b>

16:16.100 --> 16:17.940
<b>Why is it so hard to understand?</b>

16:18.060 --> 16:19.520
<b>Re-record it!</b>

16:19.850 --> 16:23.020
<b>Let's do "Lion Dance"
for our next cover!</b>

16:23.190 --> 16:26.610
<b>Nice! There are tons of
dance covers coming out now.</b>

16:26.740 --> 16:27.530
<b>Wait.</b>

16:27.650 --> 16:31.370
<b>We have to do "Robo's House"
before "Lion Dance."</b>

16:31.490 --> 16:33.370
<b>"Robo's House" is the original,</b>

16:33.490 --> 16:37.210
<b>and posting it first makes
"Lion Dance" easier to get.</b>

16:37.370 --> 16:40.960
<b>I'm telling you!
Let's do "Robo's House."</b>

16:41.080 --> 16:42.420
<b>You agree, don't you?</b>

16:42.750 --> 16:45.670
<b>- Yeah, that might be better.
- I'm not sure.</b>

16:46.510 --> 16:50.720
<b>A-ko and Clematis,
you both agree with my opinion, right?</b>

16:50.840 --> 16:52.550
<b>Let's take a vote, okay?</b>

16:53.890 --> 16:56.100
<b>I guess...</b>

16:57.390 --> 16:59.100
<b>I agree with Viola.</b>

16:59.230 --> 17:00.140
<b>I'm glad.</b>

17:00.270 --> 17:03.110
<b>Let's shoot "Robo's House" later.</b>

17:03.230 --> 17:07.150
<b>This might be nice,
in the same order as Sanpo P's posts.</b>

17:11.070 --> 17:13.410
<b>I need to talk to you about Viola</b>

17:16.330 --> 17:18.660
<b>Viola:
Did you see this?</b>

17:23.000 --> 17:26.250
<b>Let's do "Lion Dance"
for our next cover!</b>

17:26.380 --> 17:28.380
<b>I'm telling you!</b>

17:28.510 --> 17:31.930
<b>We have to do "Robo's House"
before "Lion Dance."</b>

17:32.760 --> 17:33.550
<b>Arale-chan!</b>

17:36.140 --> 17:38.980
<b>Who would post such a horrible video?</b>

17:39.270 --> 17:43.270
<b>We're having the video editor
look into it right now.</b>

17:43.400 --> 17:46.610
<b>It included content
that hadn't been posted yet.</b>

17:47.480 --> 17:51.820
<b>But the agency's getting flooded
with troll comments and inquiries,</b>

17:51.950 --> 17:53.570
<b>and they're swamped.</b>

17:54.820 --> 17:55.660
<b>Good morning.</b>

17:55.830 --> 17:57.080
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

17:57.200 --> 17:59.750
<b>What's up? Is there an event today?</b>

17:59.870 --> 18:00.710
<b>It's this.</b>

18:01.000 --> 18:02.960
<b>We have to do "Robo's House"
before "Lion Dance."</b>

18:01.210 --> 18:02.960
<b>Didn't know she was so mean</b>

18:03.120 --> 18:04.330
<b>What's this?</b>

18:04.500 --> 18:07.750
<b>Just quit already
Bet she's hated at school too</b>

18:04.670 --> 18:06.340
<b>You agree, don't you?</b>

18:06.460 --> 18:07.750
<b>Uh... yeah.</b>

18:08.300 --> 18:09.590
<b>Trash</b>

18:11.630 --> 18:12.970
<b>What is this?</b>

18:13.130 --> 18:14.890
<b>This video's fake, though.</b>

18:15.010 --> 18:19.470
<b>We can warn people about it.
Everyone's just confused.</b>

18:17.510 --> 18:19.470
<b>Erea's personality is awful</b>

18:19.640 --> 18:20.980
<b>I'm terribly sorry.</b>

18:21.230 --> 18:22.730
<b>We're looking into it...</b>

18:22.850 --> 18:26.860
<b>We will address this shortly
and get back to you.</b>

18:27.570 --> 18:29.820
<b>Yes, we will contact her parents...</b>

18:33.280 --> 18:34.950
<b>No Caller ID</b>

18:35.240 --> 18:36.570
<b>It's an unknown number.</b>

18:36.700 --> 18:38.370
<b>Don't answer it.</b>

18:44.420 --> 18:48.500
<b>I'm sorry. I know you're the one
going through all this.</b>

18:48.840 --> 18:50.090
<b>I'm just scared.</b>

18:50.460 --> 18:51.880
<b>Viola-chan.</b>

18:52.470 --> 18:54.050
<b>Ri... Rit-chan.</b>

18:54.180 --> 18:55.220
<b>Ritsu.</b>

18:55.800 --> 19:01.470
<b>What should we do?
We've worked so hard all this time.</b>

19:02.020 --> 19:05.850
<b>But if Arale-chan stays in the group,</b>

19:06.520 --> 19:09.020
<b>me, A-ko, and Ritsu...</b>

19:09.320 --> 19:12.400
<b>she'll drag us down with her.</b>

19:23.950 --> 19:25.250
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:25.750 --> 19:26.960
<b>- Arale-chan...
- Ritsu.</b>

19:30.290 --> 19:34.510
<b>Are you siding with a troublemaker?</b>

19:35.300 --> 19:37.430
<b>Even though you're a model student?</b>

19:39.550 --> 19:40.350
<b>"Just me Unlimited" Lyrics by Erea</b>

19:40.680 --> 19:41.470
<b>Isn't Clematis a bit boring?</b>

19:49.770 --> 19:54.490
<b>She's the worst
Really messed up</b>

19:50.400 --> 19:54.650
<b>I abandoned Arale-chan.</b>

19:56.240 --> 19:59.820
<b>We're announcing our first single
at the upcoming event.</b>

19:59.990 --> 20:01.370
<b>So we're debuting?</b>

20:01.490 --> 20:02.950
<b>Finally.</b>

20:04.120 --> 20:07.670
<b>There might be a chance
that Arale-chan shows up...</b>

20:07.960 --> 20:09.750
<b>I'd love to meet her.</b>

20:09.880 --> 20:12.630
<b>Send her an invitation, Ritsu.</b>

20:19.760 --> 20:20.890
<b>I was scared...</b>

20:22.100 --> 20:26.980
<b>that if I chased after Arale-chan,
I'd stop being a model student.</b>

20:27.810 --> 20:29.900
<b>Being with Viola and the others</b>

20:30.860 --> 20:32.150
<b>makes me just as bad.</b>

20:35.440 --> 20:38.740
<b>But if she can still forgive me,</b>

20:39.490 --> 20:41.570
<b>I want to apologize to her.</b>

20:41.990 --> 20:43.950
<b>Then, we can be together again.</b>

20:46.290 --> 20:47.750
<b>Rit-chan.</b>

21:00.260 --> 21:01.590
<b>Why?</b>

21:03.140 --> 21:05.890
<b>Why do you look like
you're about to cry?</b>

21:06.020 --> 21:08.480
<b>I mean...</b>

21:08.680 --> 21:09.480
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

21:10.100 --> 21:10.940
<b>Huh?</b>

21:11.270 --> 21:15.270
<b>I'm sorry for not going after you
and helping you back then.</b>

21:15.860 --> 21:16.690
<b>What?</b>

21:16.820 --> 21:19.110
<b>Even though I knew all of it...</b>

21:19.530 --> 21:22.570
<b>I don't understand what you're saying.</b>

21:22.950 --> 21:24.160
<b>I knew it...</b>

21:24.370 --> 21:25.910
<b>But I...</b>

21:26.040 --> 21:27.080
<b>It's too late!</b>

21:35.670 --> 21:36.750
<b>Sorry.</b>

21:37.840 --> 21:39.010
<b>I'm scared.</b>

21:55.900 --> 22:03.610
<b><i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i></b>

22:03.740 --> 22:07.450
<b><i>How will you live today?</i></b>

22:07.580 --> 22:15.420
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

22:19.550 --> 22:27.180
<b><i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i></b>

22:27.390 --> 22:35.310
<b><i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i></b>

22:35.690 --> 22:43.320
<b><i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i></b>

22:43.610 --> 22:51.910
<b><i>Come with us
To uncover the wonders of the universe</i></b>

22:52.960 --> 23:00.710
<b><i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i></b>

23:00.840 --> 23:04.510
<b><i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i></b>

23:04.630 --> 23:11.890
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:12.600 --> 23:19.650
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:25.610 --> 23:28.700
<b>Cold Smile, the leader
of the Shani-comers, appears.</b>

23:28.820 --> 23:31.990
<b>That strength is making
our lactic acid pile up.</b>

23:32.120 --> 23:35.540
<b>Next episode,
"Magical Physical Kululu, a new power."</b>

23:32.870 --> 23:37.170
<b>Help</b>

23:35.660 --> 23:39.840
<b>Fresh vitamin foam!
Next week, dreams are power!</b>
